{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Unified Quality Gate",
  "description": "Enterprise-grade quality checks with OMNIDEV GODMODE integration. Validates syntax, types, sprint alignment, accessibility, security, and performance.",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "userTriggered",
    "patterns": [
      "backend/**/*.py",
      "extension/**/*.ts",
      "extension/**/*.js",
      "**/*.tsx",
      "**/*.jsx",
      "backend/src/**/*.py"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "Execute the unified quality gate checks following the specifications in .kiro/hooks/unified-quality-gate.md\n\nAnalyze the currently active file or all files in the current context.\n\nRun these checks based on enabled modules in UNIFIED_MASTER_FRAMEWORK_v3.md:\n\nCRITICAL (Always Run - Blocking):\n1. Error Detection - syntax, types, imports, linting\n2. Sprint Alignment - validate against current sprint tasks\n\nOPTIONAL (Module-Aware):\n3. Auto Test - if Godmode or DevOps enabled\n4. Accessibility Check - if CurrentSprintFocus enabled\n5. Code Quality Review - if Godmode or Strategic enabled\n6. Security Scan - if DevOps enabled\n7. Performance Check - if DevOps or Godmode enabled\n8. AI Linter - if Godmode enabled\n\nProvide a structured report with severity levels:\n- CRITICAL 🔴 (blocks commit)\n- HIGH 🟡 (warns)\n- MEDIUM 🔵 (info)\n- LOW ⚪ (optional)\n\nInclude AURA-DEV OMNIDEV validation when Godmode is active.\n"
  }
}
